Subject: [PATCH 3/3] Connect to PostgreSQL on the port of the configuration
 file

The port of a [dataset] section was read but not given to psycopg2.connect,
which then used 5432: a PostgreSQL server on another port was not reached
(or, worse, another server on 5432 was). MySQL connections already pass it.
The RML-IO test case RMLSTC0006a (kg-construct/rml-io) fails so on a server
started on another port. Test: tests/test_postgres_port.py.
